{{Nihongo|'''Takamaikan Baliscans'''|高邁館バリスカン|Takamaiku Barisukanjin|lead=yes|{{langx|bl|Takamaico-baliscanos}}}} are [[Baliscans|Baliscan citizens]] who are nationals of [[Takamaiku|Takamaikan]] ancestry or Takamaikan immigrants living in [[Balisca]]. In 2024, [[Instituto Confederal de Stadística]] (ICS) stated that there were roughly 400,000 Takamaikan descendants in Balisca, making it the country with the largest population of Takamaikan origin outside of [[W:East Asia|East Asia]]. 

